><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg></div><div data-slot=\"card-title\" class=\"font-semibold text-lg\">User Responsibilities</div></div><div data-slot=\"card-content\" class=\"px-6\"><div data-slot=\"card-description\" class=\"text-muted-foreground text-sm\">Proper use of services and compliance with applicable laws</div></div></div><div data-slot=\"card\" class=\"bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border py-6 shadow-sm text-center\"><div data-slot=\"card-header\" class=\"@container/card-header grid auto-rows-min grid-rows-[auto_auto] items-start gap-1.5 px-6 has-data-[slot=card-action]:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] [.border-b]:pb-6\"><div class=\"mx-auto mb-4 p-3 bg-primary/10 rounded-full w-fit\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg></div><div data-slot=\"card-title\" class=\"font-semibold text-lg\">Intellectual Property</div></div><div data-slot=\"card-content\" class=\"px-6\"><div data-slot=\"card-description\" class=\"text-muted-foreground text-sm\">Respect for SAIL&#x27;s and third-party intellectual property rights</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-16\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-4\">Service Terms &amp; Conditions</h2><p class=\"text-lg text-muted-foreground max-w-3xl mx-auto\">Detailed terms that apply to your use of our services</p></div><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div data-slot=\"card\" class=\"bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border py-6 shadow-sm\"><div data-slot=\"card-header\" class=\"@container/card-header grid auto-rows-min grid-rows-[auto_auto] items-start gap-1.5 px-6 has-data-[slot=card-action]:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] [.border-b]:pb-6\"><div data-slot=\"card-title\" class=\"font-semibold text-xl\">Account Creation</div><div data-slot=\"card-description\" class=\"text-muted-foreground text-sm\">You must provide accurate information and maintain account security</div></div><div data-slot=\"card-content\" class=\"px-6\"><div class=\"space-y-2\"><h4 class=\"font-medium text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Requirements:</h4><ul class=\"space-y-1\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-primary rounded-full\"></div><span>Valid email address</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-primary rounded-full\"></div><span>Secure password</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-primary rounded-full\"></div><span>Company information</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div data-slot=\"card\" class=\"bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border py-6 shadow-sm\"><div data-slot=\"card-header\" class=\"@container/card-header grid auto-rows-min grid-rows-[auto_auto] items-start gap-1.5 px-6 has-data-[slot=card-action]:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] [.border-b]:pb-6\"><div data-slot=\"card-title\" class=\"font-semibold text-xl\">Acceptable Use</div><div data-slot=\"card-description\" class=\"text-muted-foreground text-sm\">Services must be used for lawful purposes only</div></div><div data-slot=\"card-content\" class=\"px-6\"><div class=\"space-y-2\"><h4 class=\"font-medium text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Requirements:</h4><ul class=\"space-y-1\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-primary rounded-full\"></div><span>No illegal activities</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-primary rounded-full\"></div><span>No system abuse</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-primary rounded-full\"></div><span>Respect for others</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div data-slot=\"card\" class=\"bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border py-6 shadow-sm\"><div data-slot=\"card-header\" class=\"@container/card-header grid auto-rows-min grid-rows-[auto_auto] items-start gap-1.5 px-6 has-data-[slot=card-action]:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] [.border-b]:pb-6\"><div data-slot=\"card-title\" class=\"font-semibold text-xl\">Data &amp; Privacy</div><div data-slot=\"card-description\" class=\"text-muted-foreground text-sm\">Compliance with our privacy policy and data protection laws</div></div><div data-slot=\"card-content\" class=\"px-6\"><div class=\"space-y-2\"><h4 class=\"font-medium text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Requirements:</h4><ul class=\"space-y-1\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-primary rounded-full\"></div><span>Consent for data processing</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-primary rounded-full\"></div><span>No unauthorized sharing</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-primary rounded-full\"></div><span>Data accuracy</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div data-slot=\"card\" class=\"bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border py-6 shadow-sm\"><div data-slot=\"card-header\" class=\"@container/card-header grid auto-rows-min grid-rows-[auto_auto] items-start gap-1.5 px-6 has-data-[slot=card-action]:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] [.border-b]:pb-6\"><div data-slot=\"card-title\" class=\"font-semibold text-xl\">Service Limitations</div><div data-slot=\"card-description\" class=\"text-muted-foreground text-sm\">Understanding of service availability and technical constraints</div></div><div data-slot=\"card-content\" class=\"px-6\"><div class=\"space-y-2\"><h4 class=\"font-medium text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Requirements:</h4><ul class=\"space-y-1\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-primary rounded-full\"></div><span>No guaranteed uptime</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-primary rounded-full\"></div><span>Feature availability</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-primary rounded-full\"></div><span>Technical support</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-16\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-4\">Prohibited Activities</h2><p class=\"text-lg text-muted-foreground max-w-3xl mx-auto\">Activities that are not allowed when using our services</p></div><div data-slot=\"card\" class=\"bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border py-6 shadow-sm\"><div data-slot=\"card-header\" class=\"@container/card-header grid auto-rows-min grid-rows-[auto_auto] items-start gap-1.5 px-6 has-data-[slot=card-action]:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] [.border-b]:pb-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert h-6 w-6 text-red-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><div data-slot=\"card-title\" class=\"font-semibold text-xl text-red-600\">What You Cannot Do</div></div><div data-slot=\"card-description\" class=\"text-muted-foreground text-sm\">Violation of these terms may result in account suspension or termination</div></div><div data-slot=\"card-content\" class=\"px-6\"><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 p-3 bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-950/20 rounded-lg\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-red-500 rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0\"></div><span class=\"text-sm\">Attempting to reverse engineer or hack our services</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 p-3 bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-950/20 rounded-lg\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-red-500 rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0\"></div><span class=\"text-sm\">Using services for illegal or unauthorized purposes</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 p-3 bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-950/20 rounded-lg\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-red-500 rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0\"></div><span class=\"text-sm\">Interfering with other users&#x27; access to services</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 p-3 bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-950/20 rounded-lg\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-red-500 rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0\"></div><span class=\"text-sm\">Attempting to gain unauthorized access to our systems</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 p-3 bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-950/20 rounded-lg\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-red-500 rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0\"></div><span class=\"text-sm\">Using services to transmit malware or harmful code</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 p-3 bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-950/20 rounded-lg\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-red-500 rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0\"></div><span class=\"text-sm\">Violating intellectual property rights of others</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 p-3 bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-950/20 rounded-lg\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-red-500 rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0\"></div><span class=\"text-sm\">Engaging in any form of harassment or abuse</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 p-3 bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-950/20 rounded-lg\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-red-500 rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0\"></div><span class=\"text-sm\">Attempting to circumvent usage limits or restrictions</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-16\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-4\">Payment &amp; Billing Terms</h2><p class=\"text-lg text-muted-foreground max-w-3xl mx-auto\">Important information about pricing, billing, and payment terms</p></div><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div data-slot=\"card\" class=\"bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border py-6 shadow-sm\"><div data-slot=\"card-header\" class=\"@container/card-header grid auto-rows-min grid-rows-[auto_auto] items-start gap-1.5 px-6 has-data-[slot=card-action]:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] [.border-b]:pb-6\"><div data-slot=\"card-title\" class=\"font-semibold text-xl\">Billing &amp; Subscriptions</div></div><div data-slot=\"card-content\" class=\"px-6 space-y-4\"><div class=\"space-y-2\"><h4 class=\"font-medium\">Free Tier</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">No credit card required. Access to basic features with usage limits.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><h4 class=\"font-medium\">Paid Plans</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Monthly or annual billing. Automatic renewal unless cancelled.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><h4 class=\"font-medium\">Usage Limits</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Plans include specific user and action limits. Overage charges may apply.</p></div></div></div><div data-slot=\"card\" class=\"bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border py-6 shadow-sm\"><div data-slot=\"card-header\" class=\"@container/card-header grid auto-rows-min grid-rows-[auto_auto] items-start gap-1.5 px-6 has-data-[slot=card-action]:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] [.border-b]:pb-6\"><div data-slot=\"card-title\" class=\"font-semibold text-xl\">Refunds &amp; Cancellations</div></div><div data-slot=\"card-content\" class=\"px-6 space-y-4\"><div class=\"space-y-2\"><h4 class=\"font-medium\">Cancellation</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Cancel anytime through your account settings. No long-term commitments.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><h4 class=\"font-medium\">Refunds</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Pro-rated refunds for annual plans. Monthly plans are non-refundable.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><h4 class=\"font-medium\">Data Retention</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Your data is retained for 30 days after cancellation for recovery purposes.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-16\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-4\">Intellectual Property Rights</h2><p class=\"text-lg text-muted-foreground max-w-3xl mx-auto\">Understanding who owns what in our relationship</p></div><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div data-slot=\"card\" class=\"bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border py-6 shadow-sm\"><div data-slot=\"card-header\" class=\"@container/card-header grid auto-rows-min grid-rows-[auto_auto] items-start gap-1.5 px-6 has-data-[slot=card-action]:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] [.border-b]:pb-6\"><div data-slot=\"card-title\" class=\"font-semibold text-xl\">SAIL&#x27;s Rights</div></div><div data-slot=\"card-content\" class=\"px-6 space-y-3\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">SAIL retains all rights to our platform, software, and intellectual property.</p><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-primary rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0\"></div><span>Platform and software code</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-primary rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0\"></div><span>Brand names and trademarks</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-primary rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0\"></div><span>Documentation and training materials</span></li></ul></div></div><div data-slot=\"card\" class=\"bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border py-6 shadow-sm\"><div data-slot=\"card-header\" class=\"@container/card-header grid auto-rows-min grid-rows-[auto_auto] items-start gap-1.5 px-6 has-data-[slot=card-action]:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] [.border-b]:pb-6\"><div data-slot=\"card-title\" class=\"font-semibold text-xl\">Your Rights</div></div><div data-slot=\"card-content\" class=\"px-6 space-y-3\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">You retain ownership of your content and data.</p><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-primary rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0\"></div><span>Your business data and content</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-primary rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0\"></div><span>Custom configurations and workflows</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-primary rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0\"></div><span>Feedback and suggestions you provide</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-16\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-4\">Limitation of Liability</h2><p class=\"text-lg text-muted-foreground max-w-3xl mx-auto\">Important legal limitations on our liability to you</p></div><div data-slot=\"card\" class=\"bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border py-6 shadow-sm\"><div data-slot=\"card-content\" class=\"px-6 pt-6\"><div class=\"space-y-4 text-muted-foreground\"><p>SAIL provides its services &quot;as is&quot; and &quot;as available.&quot; We do not guarantee that our services will be uninterrupted, secure, or error-free.</p><p>Our total liability to you for any claims arising from the use of our services is limited to the amount you paid us in the 12 months preceding the claim.</p><p>We are not liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, including but not limited to loss of profits, data, or business opportunities.</p><p>These limitations do not apply to claims for personal injury or property damage caused by our gross negligence or willful misconduct.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold mb-4\">Questions About These Terms?</h2><p class=\"text-lg text-muted-foreground mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Our legal team is here to help clarify any questions about these terms of service.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center\"><button data-slot=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap font-medium transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive bg-primary text-primary-foreground shadow-xs hover:bg-primary/90 h-10 rounded-md has-[&gt;svg]:px-4 px-8 py-4 text-lg\">Contact Legal Team</button><button data-slot=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap font-medium transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive border bg-background shadow-xs hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground dark:bg-input/30 dark:border-input dark:hover:bg-input/50 h-10 rounded-md has-[&gt;svg]:px-4 px-8 py-4 text-lg\">Download Terms of Service</button></div></div></div><footer class=\"\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row justify-between\"><div><div c